problems.solution:
function parseQuery(query) {
  const decode = (text) => decodeURIComponent(text.replace(/\+/g, ' '));
  const result = {};
  for (const piece of query.replace(/^\?/, '').split('&')) {
    if (!piece) continue;
    const at = piece.indexOf('=');
    const key = decode(at < 0 ? piece : piece.slice(0, at));
    const value = at < 0 ? '' : decode(piece.slice(at + 1));
    if (!Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(result, key)) result[key] = value;
    else if (Array.isArray(result[key])) result[key].push(value);
    else result[key] = [result[key], value];
  }
  return result;
}

statement.zh:
实现 `renderTemplate(template, data)`：把模板里的 `{{ 路径 }}` 换成 `data` 里对应的值。

- 花括号内侧可以有空格：`{{name}}` 和 `{{ name }}` 等价；
- 路径可以用 `.` 访问嵌套属性，例如 `{{ user.name }}`；
- 值不存在（或为 `null`、`undefined`）时替换成空字符串；其余值用 `String(value)` 转换；
- 只处理成对的双花括号，单个 `{` `}` 原样保留；
- 不对值做二次替换：值里出现的 `{{x}}` 原样输出。

```js
renderTemplate('Hi {{ user.name }}, you have {{count}} new {{ what }}.', {
  user: { name: 'Ada' }, count: 0,
});
// 'Hi Ada, you have 0 new .'
```

statement.en:
Implement `renderTemplate(template, data)`: replace each `{{ path }}` in the template with the matching value from `data`.

- Spaces inside the braces are allowed: `{{name}}` and `{{ name }}` are the same;
- paths reach nested properties with `.`, e.g. `{{ user.name }}`;
- a missing value (or `null` / `undefined`) becomes an empty string; any other value goes through `String(value)`;
- only paired double braces count; single `{` and `}` stay as they are;
- values are not rendered again: a `{{x}}` inside a value is output as it is.

```js
renderTemplate('Hi {{ user.name }}, you have {{count}} new {{ what }}.', {
  user: { name: 'Ada' }, count: 0,
});
// 'Hi Ada, you have 0 new .'
```

problems.starter:
